DATA SOURCES (bound through the @Observable model; web hook names kept at call sites)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  useVehicles    -> IngestXRayDataSource.loadVehicles()                          (GET /vehicles)
  useIngestXRay  -> IngestXRayDataSource.loadXRay(vehicleID:window:bucket:limit:) (GET /system/ingest-xray/{numericId}?window=&bucket=&limit=100)
  The report feed is enabled only once a vehicle is picked (web `enabled: numericId > 0`).
  Selecting a vehicle / window / bucket re-runs the report (web TanStack query-key change);
  a too-coarse bucket (bucket >= window) is reproduced as the server's 400 -> the error state.
  A monotonic generation token discards a stale in-flight report when the selection changes.

